### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. API Health Check / Welcome
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. Get All Products (Status 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### 3. Get All Products with Search Filter (Status 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=keyboard

### 4. Get All Products with Sorting by Price Ascending (Status 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?sort=price_asc

### 5. Get All Products with Sorting by Price Descending (Status 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?sort=price_desc

### 6. Get Single Product by Existing ID (Status 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### 7. Get Single Product by Non-existent ID (Status 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/999999

### 8. Add a New Product - Success (Status 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mechanical Numpad",
  "price": 34.99,
  "quantity": 2
}

### 9. Add a New Product - Missing Name Error (Status 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 25.00
}

### 10. Add a New Product - Invalid Price Error (Status 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Invalid Item",
  "price": -10,
  "quantity": 1
}

### 11. Update an Existing Product (Status 200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard RGB",
  "price": 99.99,
  "quantity": 3
}

### 12. Update a Non-existent Product (Status 404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/999999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Non-existent",
  "price": 10.00
}

### 13. Delete an Existing Product (Status 200)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/4

### 14. Delete a Non-existent Product (Status 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/999999
